DESCRIPTION=Auto-recover blank or all-zero drive.img on startup by overwriting it with a fresh FAT32 default image (disk_reinit_default_fat32); adds scripts/install_deps.sh for one-shot apt install of gcc, GAS, AArch64 cross toolchain, OpenSSL, SQLite, SDL2, and test tools.
